<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">DRIP-R</span>: A Benchmark for Decision-Making and Reasoning Under Real-World Policy Ambiguity in the Retail Domain</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
